DTSTAMP:20261117T003912Z
DTSTART:20270316T063000
DTEND:20270316T070000
SUMMARY:[RW] Sharpener (4 x 2 min) (30 min)
DESCRIPTION:10 min warm-up\; 4 x (2 min threshold + 2 min easy)\; 8 min co
 ol-down. Short and crisp\, then stop. The taper keeps a little intensity 
 while volume drops (Bosquet 2007).\n\nWeek 17 (TAPER). Not medical advice
 \; pain that changes how you move means stop.\nrampwise-plan
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:2027-03-17-bike_x-easy-ride-cross-trai@rampwise
DTSTAMP:20261117T003912Z
DTSTART:20270317T063000
DTEND:20270317T071000
SUMMARY:[RW] Easy ride (cross-training) (40 min)
DESCRIPTION:8 min warm-up\; 27 min easy\; 5 min cool-down. Low-impact aero
 bic work next to the running: Mostly steady endurance (RPE 2-3\, 56-75 % 
 of FTP if you use power). Eat and drink on rides over 90 minutes.\n\nWeek
  17 (TAPER). Not medical advice\; pain that changes how you move means st
 op.\nrampwise-plan
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
