SUMMARY:[RW] Easy run (30 min)
DESCRIPTION:5 min warm-up\; 20 min easy\; 5 min cool-down. Easy means RPE 
 2-3: you can talk in full sentences. Use your watch's easy heart-rate zon
 e if you have one.\n\nWeek 17 (TAPER). Not medical advice\; pain that cha
 nges how you move means stop.\nrampwise-plan
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
