SUMMARY:[RW] Activation (20 min easy run + 3 short pickups) (20 min)
DESCRIPTION:20 min easy with 3 pickups of 15 s at race effort. Pack your k
 it\, check your gear\, eat normally\, sleep.\n\nWeek 17 (TAPER). Not medi
 cal advice\; pain that changes how you move means stop.\nrampwise-plan
